        "Apply the chain rule for connected rates of change with $\\frac{dV}{dt} = 20\\text{ cm}^3\\text{ min}^{-1}$:\n$$\\frac{dh}{dt} = \\frac{dV}{dt} \\div \\frac{dV}{dh} = \\frac{20}{\\frac{1}{4}h^2} = \\frac{80}{h^2}$$",
        "Evaluate $\\frac{dh}{dt}$ when $h = 10\\text{ cm}$:\n$$\\left.\\frac{dh}{dt}\\right|_{h=10} = \\frac{80}{10^2} = \\frac{80}{100} = 0.8\\text{ cm min}^{-1}$$"
